cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this material, please cite it as below."
title: "Algorithms: online lecture notes with worked exercises"
abstract: >-
  The lecture notes of the Algorithms course — representation of numbers,
  pseudo-code, introduction to C++, sorting, searching and numerical
  algorithms, input size, running time, correctness, recursion, recurrence
  relations, the Master Theorem, recursive algorithms — with definitions,
  theorems and proofs, pseudo-code, C++ code, worked examples and exercises
  with solutions.
authors:
